new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9bca45c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/notes/plan.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Product review implementation plan
+
+1. Narrow the public review response DTO and populator to id, rating, description, date, and reviewer first name; remove customer/address serialization from that response.
+2. Add whole-number rating validation and make customer review creation use the URL product id, compare the submitted customer id with the authenticated JWT customer, reject invalid ratings with 400, and reject duplicates with 409 before persistence.
+3. Make review updates locate the review by id and require the URL product to match, then merge the submitted rating/description into the existing review so merchant edits do not create or double-count reviews. Return 404 for missing or cross-product reviews.
+4. Rework product review persistence to recompute the product’s review count and one-decimal HALF_UP average from all current reviews after create, update, and delete; set both values to zero when none remain.
+5. Make the v2 product mappers expose the corrected aggregate values with one-decimal rounding rather than half-star rounding.
+6. Build the Maven modules and run the available tests, then inspect the diff and report any verification gaps.
